        "key": "mathWiz",
        "traitType": "positive",
        "scope": "ego",
        "level": 1,
        "cost": 10,
        "costText": "Cost: 10 CP",
        "description": "<p>The character can perform any feat of calculation, including the most complex and advanced mathematics, instantly and with great precision, with the same ease an unmodified human can add 2 + 3. The character can calculate odds with great precision, find correlations in numerical data, and perform similar tasks with great ease. Apply a +30 modifier on tests involving math calculations.</p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase Core Rulebook, p. 146.</em></p>"
      },
